{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/3840x1240.png?t=1743512219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PathUp!</strong> is an adventure-packed game where you face a challenging climb. Overcome obstacles, combine different mechanics, and prove that you can conquer the summit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you reach your goal?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>PathUp!</strong>, you embark on an unforgettable journey to climb to the top. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter narrow paths, steep inclines, and sharp turns that demand quick decisions and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the game, you\u2019ll need to use various mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Boost</strong> \u2013 Speed bursts to overcome difficult sections.<br>\ud83e\udd98 <strong>Jump</strong> \u2013 High jumps to clear obstacles.<br>\u2b05\ufe0f\u27a1\ufe0f <strong>Impulse Left / Impulse Right</strong> \u2013 Precise path adjustments.<br>\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Reset Car</strong> \u2013 Recover your vehicle if it flips or gets stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But be careful</strong>\u2014one mistake can send you tumbling down! The path is tough, and you never know what challenge awaits next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbe <strong>The game has several checkpoints</strong> to help you keep your progress. If you get stuck, you can return to the last safe point and continue your climb without starting over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Check out the GIFs below</strong>, showcasing different mechanics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Checkpoint</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/Chackpoint.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/PressE.gif?t=1743512219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump + Impulse Left</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/JUMP+LEFT.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump + Impulse Right</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/JUMP+RIGHT.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Turbo + Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/NOS+JUMP.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump + Reset Car</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/JUMP+RESET_CAR.gif?t=1743512219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your adventure now, overcome every challenge, and reach the summit! \u26f0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466310?t=1743512219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743512219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/10d75039d6f3ba962172b7ac22a763c6f10d42db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743512219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/10d75039d6f3ba962172b7ac22a763c6f10d42db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743512219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3475270,"description":