ump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/PressE.gif?t=1743512219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump + Impulse Left</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/JUMP+LEFT.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump + Impulse Right</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/JUMP+RIGHT.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Turbo + Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/NOS+JUMP.gif?t=1743512219\" />\u2714\ufe0f <strong>Jump + Reset Car</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/extras/JUMP+RESET_CAR.gif?t=1743512219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your adventure now, overcome every challenge, and reach the summit! \u26f0\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Geghamyan Hrachya"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466310/header.jpg?t=1743512219","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108623,"mp4":{